    "text": [
        {
            "jpName": "マチカネタンホイザ",
            "enName": "Matikanetannhauser",
            "jpText": "準備はいい？　せーの……。",
            "enText": "All ready? Aaand…",
            "nextBlock": 2,
            "voiceIdx": 0,
            "pathId": 3408271759449089664,
            "blockIdx": 1
        },
        {
            "jpName": "2人",
            "enName": "Both",
            "jpText": "ハッピーバースデー！\nネイチャ、誕生日おめでとー！",
            "enText": "Happy birthday! \nNature, have a happy birthday!",
            "nextBlock": 3,
            "voiceIdx": 1,
            "pathId": 4621855568455432312,
            "blockIdx": 2
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ナイスネイチャ",
            "enName": "Nice Nature",
            "jpText": "いや、バラバラじゃん……。\nなに言われたのかはなんとなくわかるけどさ。",
            "enText": "Uh, that was so out of sync… Though I did \nget the gist of what you were trying to say.",
            "nextBlock": 4,
            "voiceIdx": 2,
            "pathId": 5002374540070912543,
            "blockIdx": 3
        },
        {
            "jpName": "マチカネタンホイザ",
            "enName": "Matikanetannhauser",
            "jpText": "まあまあ、それよりも今日は私たち2人で\nお祝いの言葉を考えてきたんだ。",
            "enText": "Okay, forget that — we also thought of \na little message we wanted to tell you.",
            "nextBlock": 5,
            "voiceIdx": 3,
            "pathId": 4844503781604825170,
            "blockIdx": 4
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ツインターボ",
            "enName": "Twin Turbo",
            "jpText": "聞いたらきっと感動するよ！\nいくよマチタン、せーの……！",
            "enText": "You'll be moved to tears! Ready, Machitan? \nHere we go…",
            "nextBlock": 6,
            "voiceIdx": 4,
            "pathId": 1067959196828115803,
            "blockIdx": 5
        },
        {
            "jpName": "2人",
            "enName": "Both",
            "jpText": "いつもお世話してくれて、ありがとう！\nターボはネイチャに感謝してるんだから！",
            "enText": "Thanks for always looking out for us! \nYou have Turbo's eternal gratitude!",
            "nextBlock": 7,
            "voiceIdx": 5,
            "pathId": -7923781835525763899,
            "blockIdx": 6
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ナイスネイチャ",
            "enName": "Nice Nature",
            "jpText": "いや、だからバラバラでわからんって。",
            "enText": "Okay, this time I didn't catch any of it.",
            "nextBlock": 8,
            "voiceIdx": 6,
            "pathId": -817886589122730221,
            "blockIdx": 7
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ナイスネイチャ",
            "enName": "Nice Nature",
            "jpText": "……けどまあ、2人がお祝いしてくれてる\n気持ちは伝わったから、その……ありがと。",
            "enText": "But, it's the thought that counts, so… \nThank you.",
            "nextBlock": 9,
            "voiceIdx": 7,
            "pathId": -6055023133914609034,
            "blockIdx": 8
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ツインターボ",
            "enName": "Twin Turbo",
            "jpText": "えっへん、どういたしまして！",
            "enText": "Hehe, you're welcome!",
            "nextBlock": 10,
            "voiceIdx": 8,
            "pathId": -2249802572446918998,
            "blockIdx": 9
        },
        {
            "jpName": "マチカネタンホイザ",
            "enName": "Matikanetannhauser",
            "jpText": "よし、お祝いの言葉をかけたところで……。",
            "enText": "Okay, now that we got that out of the way…",
            "nextBlock": 11,
            "voiceIdx": 9,
            "pathId": 4550510335327725720,
            "blockIdx": 10
        },
        {
            "jpName": "2人",
            "enName": "Both",
            "jpText": "次はお祝いのケーキを食べに行こ～！\r\n次はお祝いのケーキを食べに行こ～！",
            "enText": "Let's go eat some birthday cake! \nLet's go eat some birthday cake!",
            "nextBlock": 12,
            "voiceIdx": 10,
            "pathId": -8757327099281005700,
            "blockIdx": 11
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ナイスネイチャ",
            "enName": "Nice Nature",
            "jpText": "……なんでそこは合うんだよって\n絶対にツッコまんぞ……。",
            "enText": "Oh, so <i>now</i> they're in— You know what, \nI'm not going to comment…",
            "nextBlock": -1,
            "voiceIdx": 11,
            "pathId": 4664434667002290847,
            "blockIdx": 12
        }
    ],
